170 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 115 0 R
/E (Accurate electricity demand forecasting is critical for power generation planning, grid stability, fuel procurement, and peak-load management. Traditional judgment-based forecasts often fail to capture the complex interactions among weather, industrial activity, residential consumption patterns, and macroeconomic conditions.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
171 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 115 0 R
/E (Predictive analytics supported by IBM SPSS Modeler enables utility companies to move from reactive load management to proactive capacity planning. SPSS Modeler provides a visual stream-based environment for data preparation, modeling, evaluation, and deployment without extensive coding.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
