<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 124 0 R
/E (This project successfully demonstrated an end-to-end predictive analytics workflow in IBM SPSS Modeler for forecasting electricity demand one year ahead. Starting from a clean historical dataset, the study compared four modeling approaches and selected a Time Series Expert Modeler solution that delivers both strong accuracy and operational practicality. The resulting monthly forecasts provide a solid foundation for generation planning, peak management, and procurement decisions.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
